tion</source> <volume>23</volume>:<fpage>387</fpage>&#x02013;397, <year>2007</year></citation></ref><ref id="r11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal">Petersen JL, McGuire DK: Impaired glucose tolerance and impaired fasting glucose: a review of diagnosis, clinical implications and management. <source>Diab Vasc Dis Res</source> <volume>2</volume>:<fpage>9</fpage>&#x02013;15, <year>2005</year><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16305067</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="t1"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Comparison of noninvasive measurements of neural function between the IGT and the healthy control group</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom"/><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom">Reference values</th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom">Subjects with IGT (<italic>n</italic> &#x0003d; 46)</th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom">Control subjects (<italic>n</italic> &#x0003d; 45)</th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom"><italic>P</italic></th><th colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="bottom"><italic>P</italic> adjusted for BMI</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">Cold detection threshold (degrees Celsius)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="char" char="." valign="top">26</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/></tr><tr><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="left" valign="top">&#x02003;&#x02003;&#x02003;&#x02003;Upper limb</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top"/><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" valign="top">30.00 (1.60)</td><td colspan="1" rowspan="1" align="center" vali